# Claude Code claude.ai skills-sync cache.
# Claude writes these into its skills dir; since ~/.claude/skills symlinks into
# this repo, they would otherwise land here. Sync is disabled via
# "syncClaudeAiSkills": false in ~/.claude/settings.json — this is a safety net
# in case it is re-enabled or a future build renames the setting.
skills/synced/
skills/.staging/
skills/.trash/
skills/.bucket-*
skills/.synced-at
